    "description": "These indicating devices are designated the DD1050, DD1050i, DD2050 and DD2060X-Series. They are designed to be used as part of a Class III or IIII non-automatic weighing instrument. They operate as single interval, multi-interval or multi-range, are self-indicating and mains or DC-powered. Any compatible load cell with a valid OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity may be used, subject to the manufacturer's compatibility of modules calculation; a load cell marked NH is allowed only if humidity testing to R76 has been conducted on it."
